<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LAMONT IS NEW EDITOR OF S.AFRICA'S BUSINESS REPORT.</title>
<headline>LAMONT IS NEW EDITOR OF S.AFRICA'S BUSINESS REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>James Lamont has been appointed the new editor of Business Report, Independent Newspapers announced on Monday.</p>
<p>Lamont, 28, the publication's current industrial editor, succeeds Peter Bruce who now heads the Financial Mail, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
